{"text": "Once there were twenty five tin soldiers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In a wooden box. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They were all brothers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because they were made. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From one old spoon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tin soldiers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Shouted a little boy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he opened the box. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They were his birthday present. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he was very happy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The soldiers wore. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Red and blue uniforms. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And carried guns. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On their shoulders. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They all looked the same. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Except for the last soldier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had only one leg. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because there was not enough tin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But he stood on one leg. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As firmly as the others stood on two. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the table. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There were many other toys. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To play with. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The most wonderful toy of all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was a paper castle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Through its little windows. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You could see into the rooms.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "c", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "t", "w", "e", "n", "t", "y", " ", "f", "i", "v", "e", " ", "t", "i", "n", " ", "s", "o", "l", "d", "i", "e", "r", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", " ", "a", " ", "w", "o", "o", "d", "e", "n", " ", "b", "o", "x", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "y", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "b", "r", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "